  "description": "CLI security scanner for MCP server configurations AND Agent Skill packages. Detects prompt injection, tool poisoning, credential exposure, data exfiltration, and supply chain vulnerabilities. 21 security rules aligned with OWASP Agentic AI Top 10 + OWASP MCP Top 10. Supports stdio, HTTP/SSE, WebSocket transports and SKILL.md scanning.",
